    {
      "class": "Lcom/onevcat/uniwebview/UniWebViewInterface;",
      "method": "_getUnityActivity",
      "descriptor": "()Landroid/app/Activity;",
      "insns": "0012 0011",
      "group": "uniwebview",
      "comment": "UniWebView is the game's in-app browser (the 'What's New' panel opened from the title screen). Every entry point is made inert, not just init: a half-initialised plugin still runs its real bodies against a dialog that was never created, and reaching it faults inside the native WebView stack - the process dies on the title-screen tap, right after Unity logs 'Using memoryadresses from more that 16GB of memory'. With the whole surface stubbed the panel opens empty and the game continues. Return kind follows the descriptor, because a wrong one fails DEX verification."
    },
